**Final engineering principle**

Build an integrated, recoverable, testable AI engineering organization.

Prefer substantial improvements to existing components over unnecessary module creation.

Maintain independent specialist ownership, preserve project knowledge, verify all implementation, and never confuse documentation, registration, or generated AI output with operational capability.
